      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STREAK OF GOD (5) finished off nicely first-up in a similar race, beaten 1.5L at Belmont. This looks to set up similarly, though he is a second-up winner in the past and the blinkers go on now. The form out of his last run has already been franked and he looks the one to beat this time. BACK TO BONDI (4) missed narrowly last time out when only 0.4L off the winner when a $21 chance. He's building nicely this campaign though and maps to get all the favours once again. He looks to have more room for improvement and that makes him an attractive commodity. JAZALOT (1) finished off strongly to score at Belmont last time and the step up in trip suits. He's a track and trip winner in the past and the horses he beat went on to race in Saturday company. He can get the job done again. BERRY BLAST (3) is better than she showed last start and can bounce back to her best. TOO MUCH TALK (2) comes through a good form race and won't be far away with Fiore hopping back on board.",
